    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sea Battle Simulator</strong> \u2013 Dive into a reimagined classic where high-stakes naval warfare meets modern gaming thrills! Get ready to command your fleet in epic, strategic battles that will keep you on the edge of your seat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Objective:</strong><br>Set sail into intense waters as you aim to sink your opponent's fleet before they can destroy yours! But this isn\u2019t just a game of blind guesses \u2013 here, precision, tactics, and cunning are the true weapons of victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Naval Combat:</strong> Every shot creates a splash \u2013 watch your ships collide with the game board in stunning, physics-driven chaos that brings the battlefield to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master Your Strategy:</strong> With only two shots per turn, every decision matters! Carefully plan each strike, anticipate your opponent\u2019s moves, and outwit them to claim victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Mayhem:</strong> Challenge friends or go head-to-head with AI opponents. Whether you're a seasoned commander or a fresh recruit, there's always a new challenge waiting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Battlefields:</strong> Conquer unique maps, each with its own strategic twists. From narrow channels to open seas, the terrain is as much a part of your plan as your fleet!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Experience:</strong> Get lost in the battle, with stunning visuals and soundscapes that make each encounter feel like an all-out naval war.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The waves are rising, the fleets are ready\u2014every shot counts in this fast-paced battle for dominance on the high seas! Will your tactics lead you to victory or will your ships be left in ruins? The choice is yours!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sea Battle Simulator</strong> \u2013 Dive into a reimagined classic where high-stakes naval warfare meets modern gaming thrills! Get ready to command your fleet in epic, strategic battles that will keep you on the edge of your seat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Objective:</strong><br>Set sail into intense waters as you aim to sink your opponent's fleet before they can destroy yours! But this isn\u2019t just a game of blind guesses \u2013 here, precision, tactics, and cunning are the true weapons of victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Naval Combat:</strong> Every shot creates a splash \u2013 watch your ships collide with the game board in stunning, physics-driven chaos that brings the battlefield to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master Your Strategy:</strong> With only two shots per turn, every decision matters! Carefully plan each strike, anticipate your opponent\u2019s moves, and outwit them to claim victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Mayhem:</strong> Challenge friends or go head-to-head with AI opponents. Whether you're a seasoned commander or a fresh recruit, there's always a new challenge waiting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Battlefields:</strong> Conquer unique maps, each with its own strategic twists. From narrow channels to open seas, the terrain is as much a part of your plan as your fleet!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Experience:</strong> Get lost in the battle, with stunning visuals and soundscapes that make each encounter feel like an all-out naval war.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The waves are rising, the fleets are ready\u2014every shot counts in this fast-paced battle for dominance on the high seas! Will your tactics lead you to victory or will your ships be left in ruins? The choice is yours!</p>",
